@startuml
title MS3 · Soumissions — Modèle de classes (S4)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ClassBorderColor #2E5A88
skinparam ArrowColor #2E5A88
skinparam FontName Helvetica
skinparam FontSize 12
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D9A400

enum SubmissionStatus <<enumeration>> {
  DRAFT
  SUBMITTED
  VERIFYING
  PASSED
  REJECTED
  WITHDRAWN
}

enum VerdictResult <<enumeration>> {
  PASS
  FAIL
}

class Challenge <<external>> {
  +id: UUID
  +deadline: LocalDateTime
}

class Applicant <<external>> {
  +id: UUID
  +displayName: String
}

class Submission <<aggregate>> {
  +id: UUID
  +challengeId: UUID
  +applicantId: UUID
  +repoUrl: URI
  +branch: String
  +status: SubmissionStatus
  +commitSha: String
  +submittedAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +create(SubmissionCreate data): Submission {static}
  +submit(): Submission
  +freezeCommit(String sha): void
  +markVerifying(): void
  +isLate(LocalDateTime deadline): boolean
  +withdraw(): void
  +canBeJudged(): boolean
}

class Verdict <<entity>> {
  +submissionId: UUID
  +result: VerdictResult
  +passed: int
  +failed: int
  +total: int
  +coverage: Double
  +logsUrl: URI
  +verifiedAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +isPass(): boolean
  +successRate(): double
  +fromVerification(Verification v): Verdict {static}
  +summary(): String
}

class TestCaseResult <<internal>> {
  +testName: String
  +outcome: VerdictResult
  +durationMs: long
  +logs: String
  --
  +isPassed(): boolean
}

Submission "0..*" --> "1" Challenge : challengeId (réf.)
Submission "0..*" --> "1" Applicant : applicantId (réf.)
Submission "1" --> "0..1" Verdict : produit
Submission "1" *-- "0..*" TestCaseResult : détail des tests
Submission --> SubmissionStatus : status
Verdict --> VerdictResult : result

note right of Submission
  Cycle de vie : DRAFT → SUBMITTED → VERIFYING
  → PASSED | REJECTED (ou WITHDRAWN).
  submit() fige commitSha et contrôle
  deadline (409 si limite dépassée).
  Émet submission.submitted vers RabbitMQ.
end note

note bottom of Verdict
  Verdict reçu de MS5 (PUT interne /verdict).
  passed + failed = total.
  coverage nullable (non calculé).
  Base H2 dédiée à MS3.
end note

note bottom of Applicant
  Référence abstraite (applicantId) vers un Developer
  ou une Team de MS2 selon applicantType.
  Aucune clé étrangère inter-services.
end note

legend bottom left
  <<external>> : référence par UUID vers MS1 / MS2.
  <<internal>> : détail non exposé tel quel par l'API OpenAPI.
end legend
@enduml
